WEBVTT

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:18.300
Misaki-san! All done for the day?

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.450
Yeah, I'm checking out.

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:20.120
What?

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.050
Daigo, you're still here?

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:24.590
Yeah, Fudo is working the late shift.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:26.380
I decided to make him some rations.

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:30.250
Truly impressive as ever!

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.460
All that on top of scouting 
out new heroes for the team.

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:35.550
You must be very busy!

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:37.140
It's not a problem.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:40.530
Well, Daigo?

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:43.980
Feel like scouting <i>me</i>
as a companion for life?

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:45.540
<i>Indifference...</i>

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:48.210
<b><i>Indifference</i></b>

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:47.070
At least don't ignore me!

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:48.470
You're making me cry!

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:51.000
Workplace relationships are off-limits.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.610
As if I don't know that! You goody-goody!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:56.920
Daigo-san is completely unflappable.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:01:01.120
He's calm by nature, 
and levelheaded in combat.

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:05.000
He never loses his cool... unlike me.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.690
Yeah. Psychologically speaking, 
Daigo is our organization's rock.

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:15.420
I brought dinner.

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:17.960
Thank you, Daigo-san.

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:20.040
Working hard?

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:22.260
I'm writing an exchange diary!

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:25.000
Oh. With the girl who 
visited you at the beach?

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:28.270
That's right. I never introduced 
the two of you, did I?

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:30.100
Her name is Desumi-san—

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:31.150
<b><i>Crash</i></b>

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:32.110
Daigo-san?

00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:37.370
D-Desu... Desu...

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:39.770
Desu...mi...

00:01:39.770 --> 00:01:41.250
A-Are you all right?!

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:44.540
Desumi... Magahara...

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.420
Daigo-san?

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:48.420
Daigo-san?!

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:24.220
<b>Infirmary</b>

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:24.220
Episode 7    Desumi Magahara Is the Monster I Made

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:26.220
Here, some water.

00:03:26.920 --> 00:03:27.960
It's appreciated.

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:38.730
Daigo-san...

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:42.330
It's hard to believe, but do 
you already know Desumi-san?

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:44.870
Yes.

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:48.270
That's right, you were also born in Hakata.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:51.380
Do you have some kind of history with her?

00:03:55.250 --> 00:04:00.260
Desumi Magahara is the monster I made.

00:04:00.810 --> 00:04:03.220
Are you saying you knew her as a child?!

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:06.130
Tell me everything!

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:08.720
<b><i>Intense</i></b>

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:08.720
Everything about Desumi-san 
that I don't already know!

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:12.550
It's a truly terrifying story.

00:04:12.550 --> 00:04:14.850
I'd prefer you not ask unless 
you're prepared for the worst.

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:16.040
That's ridiculous!

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:17.860
I'm prepared for anything!

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:20.360
Very well.

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:22.760
I'll tell you, then...

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:24.650
Of the day that the 
"Land of Demons," Fukuoka,

00:04:24.650 --> 00:04:27.640
became the home of a true demon.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:33.210
<b>Oda-Style
Karate</b>

00:04:31.310 --> 00:04:33.210
This was ten years ago.

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:38.210
<b>Oda-Style Karate</b>

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:36.250
I was still in middle school then.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:45.340
I was a promising talent 
at a famous karate school.

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:50.360
I had no rivals among the older 
students, let alone among my peers.

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:52.450
I believed myself the best in the prefecture.

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:55.960
And then... she arrived.

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:00.730
This is Desumi Magahara. She's seven.

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:02.460
Give her your best, everyone.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:05.340
<b>Oh so cute</b>

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:04.750
Oh so cute...

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:06.680
I'll ask you not to smile 
and stare absently, please.

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:08.310
There's far more to the story.

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:11.870
These were the first words out of her mouth:

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:15.560
I try to play with stuff an' always break it.

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:17.820
I'm gonna try hard not to break nothin' here!

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:19.650
Well, look at that little terror!

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:28.500
Daigo, look after her, would you?

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:34.010
Young Desu, was it?

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:35.320
I'd like to see what you can do.

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:36.350
Give me a hit, right here.

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:38.850
A hit?

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:41.080
What's that? Like a punch?

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:42.110
Yes, that's right.

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:44.740
Like this?

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:51.230
Upsy-daisy!

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:55.420
Dai-chan chose the chopsticks!

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:59.170
You're going to start learning karate today.

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:00.540
<b>Gasp!!</b>

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:03.320
<i>D-Did my life just flash before my eyes?</i>

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:01.560
<b>knock
knock</b>

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:03.320
<b>knock
knock</b>

00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:06.550
<i>I, the strongest in the dojo, 
was nearly killed by a second-grader?!</i>

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:06.550
<b>knock
knock</b>

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:09.050
Sorry. It didn't hurt too bad, did it?

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:13.430
It was an excellent straight punch, 
but it didn't even faze me.

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.580
S-So cool!

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:17.180
You're the first thing I couldn't break!

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:20.020
Can I hit you again?!

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:22.130
N-Not... today.

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:23.820
I don't want you hurting your fists.

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:29.940
Let's play again, Daigo-niichan!

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:34.410
Little Desumi-san is everything 
I'd expect! A true child prodigy!

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:37.700
I didn't entirely believe it at the time.

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:40.040
I chalked it up to dumb luck.

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:42.420
But then, the next day...

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:45.800
Good morning.

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:48.300
Instructor, why are you taking down the sign?

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:52.050
I'm sorry, but I'm closing the dojo.

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:57.820
I was trying to train a second-grader...

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:00.670
and she actually <i>beat</i> me.

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:02.700
I'm a failure as an instructor.

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:04.570
I'm going to become a hermit.

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:05.690
There's no way...

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:15.500
Daigo-niichan!

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:16.830
Young Desu?

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:20.140
I heard the dojo was goin' away.

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:24.270
This is always what happens.

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:28.530
Every place where I have fun

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:31.300
always goes away...

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:43.770
Don't worry, Young Desu.

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:45.660
I'll train you.

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:49.030
So please, no more tears.

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:52.100
Daigo-niichan!

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:57.780
<b>Fair and Equal</b>

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:56.470
Starting today, I will be your teacher.

00:07:58.460 --> 00:08:01.430
I had no way of knowing this at the time,

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:04.660
but that was the moment 
I'd opened Pandora's box.

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:19.180
You've improved quite a lot.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:23.050
But I fear you're a long 
way from catching up to me.

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:27.440
I was desperate to save face as her teacher.

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:30.220
You're so strong, Instructor!

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:33.450
But all I did was stoke her enthusiasm.

00:08:34.020 --> 00:08:36.260
I worked desperately to make myself stronger

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:38.270
just to keep her from killing me.

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:42.200
So Desumi-san is the reason 
why you're so strong!

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:44.710
And as the days passed...

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:50.340
Hey! You Desumi Magahara?

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:56.100
Looks like your average 
middle schooler to me.

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:59.600
But takin' her down'll be our ticket to fame!

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:03.280
Rumors spread like wildfire,

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:07.100
and soon, Young Desu was forced 
to deal with hooligans constantly.

00:09:07.490 --> 00:09:10.640
I gotta make dinner for 
my little brothers today.

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:12.090
Mind givin' me a break?

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:13.970
Too bad, girlie!

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:16.070
Your little bros'll have 
to go hungry tonight!

00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:24.580
And soon, Young Desu became known 
as the Reaper of Oyafuko-dori.

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:26.480
What a fun nickname!

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:28.520
I'll tease her about it 
in our exchange diary.

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:32.030
Then, during the last
winter of high school,

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:35.740
my parents divorced,
and I had to move to Tokyo.

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:41.470
But I had one last piece 
of business to take care of.

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:49.750
Settling things with Young Desu!

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:53.320
It's been forever, Daigo-niichan!

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:54.610
Where ya been?

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:56.020
Listen closely, Young Desu.

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:00.620
This will be our final practice.

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:02.870
Let us both give it all we have.

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:09.370
<i>I've been training hard for so 
long in anticipation of this day.</i>

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:14.760
<i>I made this monster. Now I must slay it!</i>

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:17.380
Let's begin!

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:23.890
Two minutes later, I lay upon the 
ground like a tattered rag.

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:26.170
We said we wouldn't take 
it easy on each other,

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:27.510
but you totally held back on me.

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:29.540
<i>I swear to God, I didn't.</i>

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:32.820
What kind of instructor could 
go all-out on his student?

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:35.950
<i>What a fool I am.</i>

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:38.950
Farewell, Young Desu.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:40.990
Daigo-niichan!

00:10:42.550 --> 00:10:44.830
Will I ever see you again?

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:45.850
<i>You will not.</i>

00:10:45.850 --> 00:10:49.550
When we meet again, will we practice 
together again, like we did today?

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:50.830
<i>Absolutely not.</i>

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:54.190
When we do, I promise to go 
all-out for the first time!

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:55.800
<i>She wasn't even going all-out back there?</i>

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:56.900
<i>Terrifying...</i>

00:10:56.900 --> 00:10:58.280
<i>Terrifying...</i>

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:01.070
I left for Tokyo like a man on the run,

00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:03.050
and was scouted to be a hero.

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:07.000
It appears the memories 
were so frightening to me,

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:08.840
I unconsciously sealed them away.

00:11:09.150 --> 00:11:10.870
It's pathetic, I'm sure.

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:15.030
But I can't believe she's here in Tokyo.

00:11:15.350 --> 00:11:16.700
What in the world brought her here?

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:19.530
<i>It's because she's a Gekko executive!</i>

00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:24.310
She didn't seem to recognize 
me during the barbecue,

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:27.080
but it's only a matter of time 
until she figures out who I am.

00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:32.170
I wonder. Does she still have the power 
that earned her the "Reaper" nickname?

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:34.380
M-Most likely.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:35.820
I see.

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:37.890
Then I must prepare myself.

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:41.470
Fudo, you are aware that workplace 
romance is forbidden here, correct?

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:42.600
Yes.

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:43.390
Listen to me.

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:47.890
Tremble

00:11:43.690 --> 00:11:47.100
You need to break up with her at once.

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:47.890
What?

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:50.630
I am going to find Desumi Magahara—

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:53.270
D-Daigo-san?

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:55.240
—and s-scout her for our team!

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:56.270
What?!

00:11:57.340 --> 00:11:59.220
You're having trouble even saying it.

00:11:59.220 --> 00:12:00.580
Of course I'm having trouble.

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:02.670
Th-The thought of even 
talking to Young Desu—

00:12:02.670 --> 00:12:05.350
The thought of even talking 
to her terrifies me!

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:08.740
But this is all for the sake of world peace!

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:15.830
<b>Desperation</b>

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:13.330
As the person in charge of personnel 
scouting for a hero organization,

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:15.830
I cannot simply neglect to pursue her talent!

00:12:17.030 --> 00:12:19.250
<i>Desumi-san... part of Gelato 5?</i>

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:22.100
I'm Black Gelato! Nice to work with you!

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:24.760
Black Gelato!

00:12:22.650 --> 00:12:24.760
<b>Oh so cute</b>

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:24.290
<i>Oh so cute!</i>

00:12:25.190 --> 00:12:26.340
Fudo!

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:28.830
First, I need to learn more about her.

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:29.770
Come with me.

00:12:30.490 --> 00:12:31.420
<i>I think...</i>

00:12:32.470 --> 00:12:35.260
<i>this might end up being 
more trouble than expected.</i>

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:40.020
Love After World Domination!

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:46.950
<b>Gusco</b>

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:53.460
N-Now, Daigo-san.

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:55.460
Allow me to officially introduce...

00:12:55.820 --> 00:12:57.710
Desumi-san.

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:00.150
It's been so long, Daigo-niichan!

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:01.340
How ya been?

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:03.290
Fine.

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:05.140
You appear to be well, as well.

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:18.100
<b><i>Tremble</i></b>

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:18.100
<b><i>Tremble</i></b>

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:08.500
<i>Allow me to explain!</i>

00:13:08.500 --> 00:13:12.430
<i>Desumi-phobic Green Gelato, 
A.K.A. Daigo Todoroki,</i>

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:17.050
<i>has decided to risk life and 
limb to scout Desumi as a hero!</i>

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:20.580
That sure was some surprise!

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:24.110
I never thought you'd turn out 
to be a member of Gelato 5!

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:27.320
I didn't recognize you at 
the barbecue at all, either!

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:30.080
It's gotta be 'cause you 
changed your last name, huh?

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:32.310
Boy, that takes me back!

00:13:32.310 --> 00:13:35.000
I can't forget those days 
we spent trainin' together.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.580
Daigo-niichan!

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:39.940
I-Indeed.

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:42.150
I know!

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:44.420
You oughta train me again, 
just like old times!

00:13:46.370 --> 00:13:49.180
I think I've maybe even grown a 
little bit stronger since then!

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:52.200
A-Actually...

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:54.040
Come on now, Desumi-san.

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:55.930
Daigo-san is a busy man.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:57.560
You mustn't make demands on his time.

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:00.020
<i>Fudo...</i>

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:00.020
Relief

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:01.770
That's true.

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:04.000
<b>Disappointment...</b>

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:03.640
I was just so surprised to see you again...

00:14:03.640 --> 00:14:05.250
I'm sorry for getting carried way.

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:07.700
Do you think you could do it after all?

00:14:08.010 --> 00:14:09.160
Fudo!

00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:11.190
That's it!

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:12.950
I'll get something from the drink bar!

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:18.280
Are you all right, Daigo-san?

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:22.740
Trauma isn't something you 
can shrug off so easily.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:27.640
Are you really dating?

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:31.830
She isn't coercing you, is she?

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:34.330
She's not threatening to kill you 
if you don't go out with her?

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:36.180
You're making me angry, Daigo-san.

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:38.600
You can trust in one thing:

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:42.190
I truly, truly love Desumi-san.

00:14:50.930 --> 00:14:53.400
Y-You're making me blush, Fudo.

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:56.160
Y-You heard that, Desumi-san?

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:59.160
Th-That green tea cake looks delicious.

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:02.760
Would you like a bite?

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:05.400
Aah...

00:15:07.440 --> 00:15:10.680
<b><i>Twitch</i></b>

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:09.010
H-Hang on a minute!

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:11.170
It's too soon for us to do such things!

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:13.680
That would be an indirect kiss, remember?!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:16.030
You're so bashful, Desumi-san!

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:19.670
Perhaps it's time to get down to business.

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:21.080
Oh, right...

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:23.930
You were wantin' somethin' 
from me, right, Daigo-niichan?

00:15:25.380 --> 00:15:26.930
Desumi Magahara...

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:31.320
I've come here to scout you for Gelato 5.

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:37.700
The power you possess 
should be used for justice.

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:40.830
Me? A member of Gelato 5?

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:43.080
Daigo-san. About that...

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:47.090
<i>If I was...</i>

00:15:48.230 --> 00:15:51.260
<i>Could we be together all the time, then?</i>

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:56.350
<b>Hee hee hee...</b>

00:15:56.350 --> 00:16:03.370
<b>Scoop!!
Red & Black</b>

00:15:56.350 --> 00:16:03.370
<b>Announce Their Relationship!!</b>

00:15:56.610 --> 00:15:58.420
<i>And not only that!</i>

00:15:58.420 --> 00:16:02.090
<i>We could date in public, 
without fear of scandal!</i>

00:16:04.390 --> 00:16:06.360
What do you say, Young Desu?

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:20.630
I'm sorry, Daigo-niichan.

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:22.610
I would love to accept your offer,

00:16:22.610 --> 00:16:24.620
but I just can't.

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:25.840
Why not?

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:27.340
What objections could you have?

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:29.170
<b>Gelato 5 
New Employee Guide

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:29.170
We offer paid vacation.

00:16:30.610 --> 00:16:33.470
I'm more than happy where I am.

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:36.430
I think bein' any happier would 
earn me some karmic retribution.

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:40.910
Besides, I've got my hands full with Gekko—

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:44.120
With <i>get-going</i> to school every day, she said!

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:45.450
Right, Desumi-san?

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:47.300
<i>That's right!</i>

00:16:47.300 --> 00:16:50.650
<i>I can't say that, not even to Daigo-niichan!</i>

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:52.270
I'm sorry, Fudo.

00:16:52.270 --> 00:16:53.370
I was careless.

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:55.270
Yes. We should both be careful.

00:16:56.020 --> 00:16:57.530
B-But...

00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:00.790
<i>Her lips are so soft!</i>

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:04.290
<b>Blush</b>

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:09.790
<b>Gelato 5 New Employee Guide
 You Could Be the Sixth!
Generous Benefits</b>

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:09.790
<b>bap bap</b>

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:09.790
<b>bap bap</b>

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:14.390
<i>What in the world am I
being forced to look at?</i>

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:22.070
<i>Is this truly Desumi Magahara, the girl 
once feared as the Reaper of Oyafuko-dori?</i>

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:24.480
<i>Back when I knew you,</i>

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:27.710
<i>you always seemed lonely, and somehow bored.</i>

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:32.190
<i>You had the air of a woman 
isolated by her supremacy.</i>

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:34.990
Say, "Aah"!

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:34.990
<i>Quite frankly...</i>

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:39.390
<i>I sense none of that air of invincibility 
you projected back in the day.</i>

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:40.120
Aah...

00:17:41.380 --> 00:17:45.370
<i>Love has made you weak!</i>

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:51.130
<b>Desumi</b>

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:50.420
<i>And in that time, I have continued 
training via my battles against evil.</i>

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:54.760
<i>That's right, Daigo Todoroki!</i>

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:58.130
<i>What need is there to fear her now?</i>

00:17:58.790 --> 00:18:00.040
<i>You can win!</i>

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:02.100
<i>Now is the time to defeat Young Desu,</i>

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:04.140
<i>and conquer your trauma!</i>

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:06.890
Daigo-san?

00:18:07.430 --> 00:18:09.430
Step out with me, Young Desu.

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:11.850
I shall fight you, as you wished.

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:19.610
Daigo-san...

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:22.500
Why do you have to fight Desumi-san?

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:23.620
Silence, Fudo.

00:18:24.730 --> 00:18:26.210
Are you ready, Young Desu?

00:18:26.210 --> 00:18:30.110
If you defeat me in this match, I'll give
 up on scouting you for our team.

00:18:30.110 --> 00:18:31.720
That's not fair!

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:33.920
There's no way I could possibly defeat you!

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:36.550
And... If I win...

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:40.800
You will give up on your 
relationship with Fudo,

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:43.170
and join Gelato 5.

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:46.740
Give up on my relationship with Fudo?

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:47.430
Yes.

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:50.030
Because workplace relationships 
are forbidden.

00:18:58.040 --> 00:19:01.160
Shoulda told me you had a rule like that.

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:07.790
If that's what you're tellin' me...

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:11.750
This is one battle I can't afford to lose.

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:13.750
<b>Terror</b>

00:19:12.890 --> 00:19:14.010
<i>Suddenly and unconsciously,</i>

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:18.010
<i>Daigo Todoroki activated 
his suit's transformation!</i>

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:15.750
<i>Five!</i>

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:20.510
<i>The result:</i>

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:23.740
<i>He just barely escaped with his life!</i>

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:26.700
Are you all right, Daigo-san?!

00:19:27.990 --> 00:19:30.390
You went easy on me again.

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:34.900
<i>Even after I transformed, 
you still think that?</i>

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:36.740
I wanted to stop her,

00:19:36.740 --> 00:19:40.320
but I found myself entranced 
by her beautiful moves!

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:43.240
<i>And you're always so honest.</i>

00:19:44.230 --> 00:19:47.320
<i>What in the world kind of couple is this?</i>

00:19:48.070 --> 00:19:48.970
<i>How terrifying...</i>

00:19:48.970 --> 00:19:51.120
<i>How terrifying...</i>

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:54.250
It's a reunion with my pupil 
after so long, after all.

00:19:55.430 --> 00:19:58.500
I wanted to give you a win.

00:19:59.810 --> 00:20:02.650
<i>And who in the world am I, saying all this?</i>

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:06.250
Never mind.

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:10.520
For now, we'll say it's my defeat.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:12.370
But, Young Desu...

00:20:12.810 --> 00:20:14.650
Promise me one thing.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:19.690
There are many forces out there that 
would seek out power like yours.

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:25.000
If you are to join one of them, 
see that it is not Gekko.

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:37.130
It really is a problem.

00:20:37.510 --> 00:20:41.880
Does your whole organization 
just assume we're a couple?

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:46.570
Yeah... Misaki-neesan is 
spreading the rumor everywhere.

00:20:46.570 --> 00:20:49.700
They're totally dating!

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:53.020
We have been a little too comfortable lately.

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:55.670
Maybe we need to put some barriers back up.

00:20:56.260 --> 00:20:58.860
No more PDA, for one thing.

00:20:58.860 --> 00:21:01.410
R-Right.

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:03.280
You're right, Desumi-san.

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:08.530
<b>Grin Grin</b>

00:21:07.210 --> 00:21:08.060
What is it?

00:21:09.070 --> 00:21:13.120
You're a little upset about that, huh?

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:15.980
I-I'm just being serious!

00:21:15.980 --> 00:21:16.710
Don't tease—

00:21:16.850 --> 00:21:19.210
<b>Squeeze</b>

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:22.710
Wh-What are you doing?

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:25.340
For instance, if I ever try 
to do something like this...

00:21:25.710 --> 00:21:28.310
Don't be afraid to push me off, okay?

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:30.760
<i>Oh... Oh so cute!</i>

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:31.220
<b>Oh so cute</b>

00:23:21.520 --> 00:23:22.710
<b><i>Crash</i></b>

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:23.670
Daigo-san!

00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:28.550
N-N-Next...

00:23:29.570 --> 00:23:33.010
Next time: "Everybody Has a Secret or Two"!

00:23:29.860 --> 00:23:40.250
Episode 8   Everybody Has a Secret or Two

00:23:33.590 --> 00:23:35.210
See you then.

00:23:36.590 --> 00:23:38.460
Daigo-san!
